  <name>1986</name>
  <summary>Commodore C128DCR emulator</summary>
  <description>
    <p>1986 is an emulator of the Commodore C128DCR computer. It reuses the
    SDL3 display, function-key, and options-overlay conventions of the
    sibling projects (1983, 1984, 1985), the Z80 core for CP/M mode, and
    takes its 8502 (6502-like) CPU core from the reference VICE SDL port.</p>
  </description>
